{"id":28005,"slug":"y-tu-mama-tambien","title":"Y tu mamá también","year":2001,"country":"Mexico","duration":106,"spine":723,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28005-y-tu-mama-tambien","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/5f30d2a6f02704c28b2b31a9331e1f7c/9th6Iqsdh4VJpysPfdoOhLkU6YRLB9_large.jpg","description":"This smash road comedy from Oscar-winning director Alfonso Cuarón is that rare movie to combine raunchy subject matter and emotional warmth. Gael García Bernal and Diego Luna shot to international stardom as a pair of horny Mexico City teenagers from different classes who, after their girlfriends jet off to Italy for the summer, are bewitched by a gorgeous older Spanish woman (Maribel Verdú) they meet at a wedding. When she agrees to accompany them on a trip to a faraway beach, the three form an increasingly intense and sensual alliance that ultimately strips them both physically and emotionally bare. Shot with elegance and dexterity by the great Emmanuel Lubezki, Y tu mamá también is a funny and moving look at human desire.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Alfonso Cuarón","slug":"alfonso-cuaron"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Maribel Verdú","role":"Luisa Cortés","slug":"maribel-verdu"},{"actor":"Gael García Bernal","role":"Julio Zapata","slug":"gael-garcia-bernal"},{"actor":"Diego Luna","role":"Tenoch Iturbide","slug":"diego-luna"},{"actor":"Daniel Giménez Cacho","role":"Narrator","slug":"daniel-gimenez-cacho"},{"actor":"Ana López Mercado","role":"Ana Morelos","slug":"ana-lopez-mercado"},{"actor":"Arturo Ríos","role":"Esteban Morelos","slug":"arturo-rios"},{"actor":"María Aura","role":"Cecilia Huerta","slug":"maria-aura"},{"actor":"Nathan Grinberg","role":"Manuel Huerta","slug":"nathan-grinberg"},{"actor":"Verónica Langer","role":"María Eugenia Calles de Huerta","slug":"veronica-langer"},{"actor":"Giselle Audirac","role":"Nicole Bazaine","slug":"giselle-audirac"},{"actor":"Andrés Almeida","role":"Diego “Saba” Madero","slug":"andr